  "contentHtml": "<p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">선생님들께 좋은 정보만 얻어가서 항상 죄송했는데&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">부끄럽지만 자료 하나 내보아요. ^^;;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">영상 보다가&#160; 수업 시간에 사용하면 좋을 것 같아서 급하게 만들고 올립니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업시간에 영상 보여 주면서 빈 칸 채워서 제출하는 형태로 수업 진행 했습니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1학년은 2학기때 사용하려구요</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">취미는&#160;과학/확장판&#160;13화&#160;태양,&#160;2025년&#160;정말&#160;폭발할까?&#160;(feat.김수진박사) </span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1.25배속,&#160;4분30초&#160;부터&#160;보시면&#160;됩니다.</span></b></p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/XULZgWEvgV4?si=zm6OzWyAaFU8m_ff\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/XULZgWEvgV4?si=zm6OzWyAaFU8m_ff</a></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4b535e56585704b5d49f60f7773377ccfee49997?download\" data-file-name=\"태양(취미는 과학)-교사용.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"355202\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D853%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20250609110411&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F4b535e56585704b5d49f60f7773377ccfee49997')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">태양(취미는 과학)-교사용</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">346.88KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/22b20a44af9a46dbd2d09f18197de64d6fc78d84?download\" data-file-name=\"태양(취미는 과학)-학생용.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"348458\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D853%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%